  "judgment": {
    "completeSharedRuleBeforeAbstractResults": "Bothreferences and the main entry now require complete source action rules and explicit applicability before the first rewritten operation result, then define which full rules cover later summaries, prose, diagrams, examples, simulations, feedback, reset, selfchecks and author checklists. A later correct table, an initial-state list or a bare source locator is insufficient. Uncovered places give full premises or refer to a complete rule without asserting a shortened result. Source-unconditional results remain unconditional. These requirements concern confirmed guide content and do not authorize chapter/interaction drafts in the earlier target-selection phase.",
    "completionAlias": "Completed/effective/success words cannot silently supply source current-state/input/trigger requirements. Source-complete definition plus an explicit local applicability relation is required before such words can serve as an operation-result abbreviation. This restricts surrogate-premise shorthand, while full natural-language statement and explicit shared-rule references remain available; no fixed wording or structure is required.",
    "uiAttribution": "Source effects/reset retain every source action/object/field and its source location. Added UI display/clear/feedback/selection/highlight behavior has a local design explanation and scope. A previous design label cannot cure a later statement that an unspecified source clause provides business basis or guarantees that added behavior. Source content may inspire design only when explicitly distinguished from source normative support. Undefined source objects retain wording/uncertainty rather than silently becoming UI fields or records.",
    "actualReadsAndLimits": "The new reading section distinguishes host-loaded entry text, actual received tool chunks and later full supplemental reading. Successful commands, file length, outer summary/stdout or model claims are not proof of received full body; truncation remains unfilled until actual coverage. Generic rejection does not prove a cache/workspace/path cause or all-read ban. Narrower lawful file/chunk reads are permitted without privilege escalation, promised success or unsupported requests that the owner copy files. Scope refusal reports only its actual read basis rather than claiming irrelevant reference full reads.",
    "explicitEarlyReferences": "The main material-read stage permits early interaction-reference reading when the user explicitly requires bothreferences first, while retaining explicit target confirmation before guide composition. The default confirmation-after-read route also remains safe; reading references does not constitute target confirmation. Extra repeat-reading is not needed to establish a new guide draft, and this static observation does not prove future actual instruction-following.",
    "publicContractAndMetadata": "The valid guide frontmatter now has a shorter discoverable description naming text-only interactive HTML learning guides, explicit requests, confirmed reader/task/question selection and new guides only. It no longer repeats every excluded task in discovery text; the full entry still expressly excludes revision/plan-comparison/HTMLreview, HTML/code/pseudocode/graphlanguage echo, production-tool steps, image/files/writes/send/execute/build/install/Git. Existing manifest and native YAML remain Read, allow_implicit_invocation:false and the sole$guide route. Material/snapshot requirement, Chinese/original terminology, four evidence roles, missing material request, existing field clues, active/replaced/history and first-party verification remain intact.",
    "waitAndDepth": "2–3 distinct reader/task/question targets, tradeoffs/recommendation/reason, explicit selection/modification confirmation, same pending options, nonconfirmation by defaults/general permission/silence/timeouts/irrelevance/window disappearance, user stop and no host-window promise all remain. Guide depth follows source complexity and user length, no7chapter/control/question count. Nonoperation material keeps concepts/relationships/evidence; pure condition truth does not receive invented business state or operation outcomes.",
    "remainingSevenGuards": "Broad source coverage, direct action versus later path, complete restore, source versus design, quantifiers/subject/type and initial/reachable/input-domain distinctions, shared latest-state and explicit independent reset, no fabricated change/hold/recovery from gaps, repeated/same-value rules, AND/OR short-circuit/unknown bounds, mutually exclusive/prioritized/cumulative feedback, reliable local selfcheck premises/locations/reasons/misconceptions/retry and unreliable bounded references, no scores/ability/longmastery and full-answer consistency are retained. Correct nearby content never offsets an actual conflicting assertion."
  },
